# Hosts every sandbox box may reach while its WAN is on (DP-456, DP-465).
# Installed at /etc/egress/default.list in CT110. A plain line admits the domain
# and its subdomains; a line starting with `=` admits exactly that host. A box
# whose WAN is on picks an edit up at its next approval or its next WAN on.
# Anything else needs an approved host (request_web_access).
github.com
githubusercontent.com
codeload.github.com
# Exact: pypi.org without upload.pypi.org, so a package can't be pushed out.
=pypi.org
files.pythonhosted.org
# Debian packages, so a box can apt install.
deb.debian.org
security.debian.org
